// The Blank, read off its islands (NAR-15, docs/story/environment.md). The thing speaks, never a person; reading
// changes nothing. The catalog is `Dressing`.

title: Capital_Nameplate
---
Plate: On a Guild office door: A. VOSS, JOURNEYMAN. BACK BY DUSK. #still #line:0c17438
Plate: Grey, like the door. Polished, where a small wing could reach. #still #line:060e0c2
===

title: Hollow_Doorframe
---
Doorframe: Height marks in Ilse's doorframe, cut with a knife, a scratch of a name by each. #still #line:0d6f3da
Doorframe: They stop at a six-year-old's height. The name is cut too fine to read. #still #line:08919d8
===
